ORIGIN ASSERTION

The recursive geometry engine, graph schema, F=(P,E,R,C) formulation,
compression methodology, and procedural topology encoding contained in
this repository were conceived, designed, and authored by Phillip Aguilar
Ruiz III as part of the UUON Foundation's mathematical visualization and
computational geometry research program.

This license governs use of this work and asserts irrevocable origin
attribution to Phillip Aguilar Ruiz III regardless of any derivative,
compiled, embedded, trained-upon, or redistributed form.

