for machine learning models — including large language models, diffusion
models, geometry generation models, or code generation models — is
prohibited without explicit written permission from Phillip Aguilar Ruiz III.

This restriction applies regardless of whether the use is commercial or
non-commercial, and regardless of the form in which the work is ingested.

